{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國針對中國先進半導體技術的出口管制再次暴露出新的漏洞。據The Information調查報道，一些走私者正在利用特殊的晶片封裝方式，將高帶寬內存（HBM）與低端伺服器處理器組合在一起，以普通計算晶片的名義出口，隨後再將整套組件運往中國，在當地拆解並回收其中的高端HBM內存。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584838.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:11.551315+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:49:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_hash":"0be073f08d2fbbecfc283354b114d9214a163d7544f0f3e642c5344281f3e2b7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}